(text "Expander outputs power up as inputs; 10 k pull-downs hold coils, stepper power and enables off until firmware drives them." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c621bde-2c7e-4549-9552-b45757081bf0))
(text "Stepper enable polarity is set in firmware after bench check 3. Any stepper alarm drops all motors (firmware)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ff062641-ea79-4387-9578-94eb0a1f93d6))
(text "Prototyping area: 10 x 7 plated holes (+3V3 row, +5V row, 4 free rows, GND row); spare expander and I2C ch4-7 headers beside it. No 24 V." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 41278c43-b9ac-477e-8454-8559630b4e33))
(text "E-stop contact 1 sits in series with the watchdog-gated coil supply (J pins 1-2); contact 2 reports status (pins 3-4)." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4b81ca55-58e2-40b6-ab6b-25d320ab7346))
(text "Heartbeat watchdog: 74HCT123 retriggered by GPIO46. Q stays high while pulses arrive (period < ~0.2 s); otherwise the coil supply drops." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 99a2f605-9055-40f6-a007-43fead83c941))
